abstract: "World-first browser-based causal evidence triangulation engine. Implements CaMeA causal aggregation for nonlinear effect measures (OR, RR), supports 6 study design types (RCT, cohort, case-control, Mendelian randomization, ecological, cross-sectional), computes convergence metrics (DCI, MCS, BDS, CES), and applies CaMeA causal correction to produce causally interpretable pooled estimates with interactive DAG visualization and bias architecture heatmaps."
